  "limitations": [
    "These profiles describe dependencies in the currently registered Phase 4 and Phase 5 interpreter implementations only.",
    "The graph is not a complete ontology of USG reasoning stages and must be versioned when implementation dependencies change.",
    "A dependency edge does not prove that every downstream diagnostic was caused by an upstream failure.",
    "Targets without a registered dependency profile are left unattributed rather than assigned a guessed global order."
